art": 3102.42, "text": "Is just Same thing And uh In this Sense 16 k is actually Even like Overkill because You only Have 1000 Degrees of Freedom Before so Likely That there Would be A recipe That Just projects Through 1k and Still has The same Information On the ", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/iScienceLuvr/status/2088075479576367577#t=4057", "end": 4176.439, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "0647502a6ca2fbe5d7f0d6996289d53f97dbb69b61d7ef5d12b82b4a63c98b10", "start": 4057.239, "text": "And So You Might Also Discourage Doing The Prediction During The Encoder Was Trying A Lot Except That In Practice I Don' Use The Roll The Circular Shift Applied To Mask It Just Drops Performance Which Is Against What I'm Saying Here Because", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/iScienceLuvr/status/2088075479576367577#t=4414", "end": 4534.069, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "dcbc35a51c7dbef4d2e48d9f5023aedb6494b774a3045947a2fd9120396f84c5", "start": 4414.479, "text": "Its Own At The Time I Brought One State Of Art For A Couple Of Years Right So What How Did They Get It To Be Good And Stay At The Are But In General Is Quite Unstable When You Say About Who Stated Yeah Also The Eye Bot Model From The Origin", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "New Tools to Try", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/iScienceLuvr/status/2088075479576367577#t=78", "end": 197.87, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "9c78dc696d01c020cfae9e3f08449674cbbdb3cc59e0108c9795a292bed34029", "start": 78.739, "text": "great Hi everyone i'm tim As tanish said Yeah Today We're going to talk about CAPI Maybe the only precision I might add is My latest work Is not that latest This came out like a year and half ago So there's some things are Not really up to ", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/iScienceLuv